            <p class="section-sub">
              Accent, neutral tint, contrast, chrome, radius, density, rhythm, type. Every colour, size and radius is derived from them in plain CSS, in dark and in light, with no build step. A theme is a file that sets the knobs and nothing else.
            </p>
