                <void-button variant="filled"><a id="theme-open" href="/theme/?theme=void">Open it in the theme builder</a></void-button>
                <void-button variant="ghost"><a href="/getting-started/theming/">What each knob does</a></void-button>
              </void-actions>
              <p class="theme-note">
                This is the whole theme. Turn the knobs yourself in the builder and leave with your own. Text contrast is checked for every theme in both colour schemes, so no setting takes it below 4.5:1.
              </p>
